  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "The hide possesses an uncanny density that swallows both light and sound. It grants the one who wears it a ghostly presence, rendering them nearly invisible to the eyes of others and the senses of the world. Even the strongest wards of the enemy find no purchase against its shifting surface."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Matted black hide shows the jagged scars of many skirmishes and the crude stitching of hasty repairs. The garment clings to the frame, offering a muted silence that swallows the sound of footsteps."
    }
  },
